    "id": "distribute-pilot3",
    "language": "Okay, so, um, again, thinking about the same situation, um, in the middle of midfield, having just received the ball, lots of options either side of me. Um, I'm gonna try maybe this time to, um, think about how I could exploit the space behind my defender right now. So my defender's here, and my two strikers have pushed, um, the other two defenders much further away, and that sort of leaves a gap between this midfielder that I'm facing and the opposition center backs. If I can sort of get in between that gap, then I can maybe cause problems for the opposition team of, like, who's picking me up and, um, maybe create some more space for my strikers. So, um, if I unpause now, um, I'm gonna take the[0] ball, um, lay it off to [1]my right winger, and then move into the space [2]directly behind my defender here. And, you know, if I've done it quick enough, if I play a quick enough one-two, then, um, this midfielder is not gonna be able to catch up with me, and my right winger's gonna be able to give it right back to me in a very dangerous position where I have two strikers and the goal in front of me to all take advantage of.[3]",
